      "text": "3. The present C528 petition has been filed with the prayer to quash the impugned charge sheet no.201/2024 dated 19.10.2024 and cognizance order dated 17.12.2024 along with entire proceedings of Criminal Case No.3890 of 2024 (FIR No.0390 of 2023) under Sections 323, 504,\n506, 427, 498A of IPC and 3/4 of Dowry Prohibition Act, P.S. - Transit Camp, District - Udham Singh Nagar pending before the Additional Chief Judicial Magistrate, Rudrapur, District - Udham Singh Nagar.",
